    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Developing two plastic production lines (Lexan, Polycarbonate, and Acrylic) at the company&rsquo;s factory in Qassim 1st. Industrial City, with a production capacity of up to 800 kilograms per hour for each line, as part of the company&#39;s plans to expand and increase production capacity.</p>\r\n",
